OL,3,GNEWSAWork on solar canopy and charging
OL,4,Apoints to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to install a solar power canopy
OL,7,Fand electric vehicle charging points at
OL,8,Fa car park in Loughborough is set to
OL,9,Fbegin on Monday.
OL,11,FCharnwood Borough Council said 12
OL,12,Fcharging points would be installed at
OL,13,FSouthfield Road Extension car park.
OL,15,FThe authority said the canopy would
OL,16,Fproduce "electricity to support the
OL,17,Fcharging hub".
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
