OL,3,GNEWSAWork on solar canopy and charging
OL,4,Apoints to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestment for the #200,000 project had
OL,7,Fcome "through a county-wide
OL,8,Finitiative", backed by electric vehicle
OL,9,Finfrastructure funding from the
OL,10,Fgovernment, the council added.
